   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 16,
   "date": "2007-02-20T12:24:59-06:00",
   "body": "Difficult quest for my lvl 17 pally.&nbsp; the mages have frost armor, so all your attacks are slowed, plus you will be doubled by a pillager who hits crits quite a bit. This quest will probably be lots easier for other mages/warlocks",
   "replies": [
    "the lvl 14's are easy it's the lvl 15's that are near impossible - I'm a lvl14 mage and cant seem to have enoughoomph for the 15's here!"
   ]
  },
  {
   "rating": 14,
   "date": "2006-12-09T18:52:26-06:00",
   "body": "Moonbrook is the easiest place to find pillagers and looters. At the quarry, you can aggro more Defias members and get yourself killed. Also, many people are at Moonbrook most of the time so if your about to die, someone can rescue you.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 14,
   "date": "2006-01-15T00:24:59-06:00",
   "body": "(low levels go with a partner they like to aggro and double team)",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 10,
   "date": "2007-05-04T12:24:59-05:00",
   "body": "loc 45,65",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 2,
